                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5d29d16-7695-346d-9d5e-a49fcb25625d",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who institutes a legal suit; a plaintiff or complainant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "faf07529-f159-30fe-8ed4-f99386aa8575",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone acting on behalf of someone else; a guardian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c9eb20d-65b6-3b96-96e3-d6695c965749",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that takes part in some action; a doer, an agent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9be7ca0-3ab1-44d3-ad36-d1116021d52e",
                                                "sense_id": "5c9eb20d-65b6-3b96-96e3-d6695c965749",
                                                "text": "A man may be principal in an offence in two degrees. A principal, in the first degree, is he that is the actor, or absolute perpetrator of the crime; and, in the second degree, he who is present, aiding, and abetting the fact to be done."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a44d504-1a54-49f2-8e94-b4aa7724319c",
                                                "sense_id": "5c9eb20d-65b6-3b96-96e3-d6695c965749",
                                                "text": "Never, my dear Bethel, did the most feverish dreams of fiction produce scenes more painful, or more terrific, than the real events to which I have been an actor, since the date of my last letter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34bd282c-3098-4456-91b9-25be31d98f7d",
                                                "sense_id": "5c9eb20d-65b6-3b96-96e3-d6695c965749",
                                                "text": "Mr. Clay had been too prominent an actor in public affairs to allow whig deception and misrepresentation a fair opportunity for successful action."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c97d92fd-c201-3567-82b4-24d75729a12e",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who acts a part in a theatrical play or (later) in film or television; a dramatic performer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7605fe7b-e661-4306-acc4-dc7d5d7b72fe",
                                                "sense_id": "c97d92fd-c201-3567-82b4-24d75729a12e",
                                                "text": "Seems like everyone's an actor / Or they're an actor's best friend / I wonder what was wrong to begin with / That they should all have to pretend"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb9adff9-89ba-4ca8-a9c8-e968521385da",
                                                "sense_id": "c97d92fd-c201-3567-82b4-24d75729a12e",
                                                "text": "Exactly. Marijuana is something we just all gradually decided is okay, like Mark Wahlberg as a serious actor. “You know what? Sure, I’ve decided I’m fine with that.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e463253d-e9ac-4d22-b862-4b0cc05667e4",
                                                "sense_id": "c97d92fd-c201-3567-82b4-24d75729a12e",
                                                "text": "\"I'm an actress -- actor, as we have to say these days.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "243d2377-9197-35a6-91ec-4a239c59fcfa",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate or proctor in civil courts or causes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient-Rome",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "430da7ab-a033-38ea-b826-8756dcaeb457",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa5bb35-e05b-391b-b7b9-7f233152f70b",
